<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1078893/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078894" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute><choice><abbr>Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clarissimo</expan></choice> Celebrerrimoque Viro <choice><abbr>D.omino</abbr><expan>Domino</expan></choice> Johanni
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Jubentibus <choice><abbr>Illustr.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimis</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>atqu.</abbr><expan>atque</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Excell.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimis</expan></choice> Duumviris <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci
      <lb/>Procuratoribus ac <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavini</rs> Archilycei Moderato<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ribus nempe D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-1253768439" type="person">Hyeronimo Venerio</rs> ac D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Lauren<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tio Theupolo</rs> (quibus me obstrictum quam maxim<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>
      <lb/>pro tanto favore profiteor) ad Te Vir Amicissime
      <lb/>transmitto felicissimum nuntium de confirma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tione electionis <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnati</rs> Tui pro Cathe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dra mathematica; qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> utique confirmatio ante duos
      <lb/>dies felicissime et nemine penitus discrepan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>te aut dissentiente quidem decreta fuit <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Se<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>renissimo Senatu proponentibus ac instan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tibus supradictis meis <rs key="pers_DE-588-1253768439 pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Mecenatibus</rs>. Mitto
      <lb/>igitur copiam decreti ut videas quod ipse
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Tuus Nepos</rs> salarium annuum valde
      <lb/>honorificum obtinebit sexcentum videlicet
      <lb/>florenorum aut Ducatorum, quod ipsi D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Her<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>manno</rs> etiam antehac fuit solutum. Ut hanc
      <lb/>meam rudem epistolam celerrime scriptam
      <lb/>et sine revisione perlegas ipsi D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato Tuo</rs>
      <lb/>rogo, et ut ipsum etiam atque etiam horteris
      <lb/>ut quamprimum istuc discedat <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiasque</rs>
<pb facs="1078895" n="2"/>
      <lb/>petat, ante discessum me admonendo ut ipsum
      <lb/>possim recipere in domum meam. Ipsi D. D.
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-1178380696 pers_DE-588-121843858 pers_DE-588-1253768439" type="person">Moderatores</rs> expectabunt D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepotis</rs> adventum possi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bili celeritate, et ego interim enitar ut <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Pata<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vii</rs> domus eidem paretur a D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-11887733X" type="person">Poleni</rs>. De<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>precor ut ad me transmittas tua manuscripta ra<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>riora de sublimiore Mathesi, et tuas dissertatio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nes (si qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> apud Te sint) quas ego nondum vidi
      <lb/>una cum <rs key="pers_DE-588-118773321" type="person">Zwingeriana</rs> exercitatione adversus
      <lb/>usum Matheseos in Medicina<rs key="biblio_4IX5K3Q9" type="biblio"/>.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist wohl die Basler Disputation <hi rend="i">Dubitatio medica de methodo docendi medicinam mathematica</hi> (1714) mit Theodor Zwinger als Präses und Andreas Harley als Respondent. Die Schrift fragt, in welchem Umfang sich die Medizin mathematisch behandeln lässt. Johann kündigt die Übersendung in seinem <rs key="B_991170515153605501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 9. Oktober 1716 an.</note> Inter c<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tera
      <lb/>expectabo responsum ad ea qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> petii <rs key="B_991170515017205501" type="letter">altera
      <lb/>mea epistola</rs> de <rs key="biblio_8VCJJVI7" type="biblio">Theoremate</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilliano</rs>.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti zitiert den Satz über das Ausströmen gleicher Flüssigkeitsmengen aus Röhren in seinem <rs key="B_991170515017205501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 28. August 1716. Die Stelle steht bei James Keill, <rs key="biblio_8VCJJVI7" type="biblio"><hi rend="i">An Account of Animal Secretion</hi></rs> (London 1708), S. 24–25.</note></p>
  <closer><salute>Vale Vir <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> plurimum salutatus ab exi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mio <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filio</rs> tuo mihi carissimo, meque amare
      <lb/>perge.</salute><dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1716-09-25">25 <choice><abbr>Sept.<hi rend="sup">bris</hi></abbr><expan>Septembris</expan></choice> 1716</date>.</dateline></closer>
